            <ArticleTitle>Pharmacological treatment of cancer pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>536-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Pharmacological control of cancer pain is simple and can be achieved by using the simple principles of--by the ladder, by the clock, oral (if possible), and by the patient (adapted specifically). Consultation might be needed only for those patients who have difficult pain problems or refractory pain.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
